figchild — Typst port © 2026 FERGOUS Abdelhak
=====================

This package is a derivative port of the LaTeX package `figchild`
(*Figures for Creating Children's Activities*), version 3.1.2
(2026-05-29), written by Fernando de Souza Bastos
<fernando.bastos@ufv.br> and contributors (Federal University of Viçosa,
Brazil).

