    version 2005/12/01 or later.

This Typst port is distributed under the same license (LPPL-1.3c).
The rendering engine and conversion tooling are provided as-is for
interoperability with the original package.

The CeTZ and Scrawl Typst packages, used as runtime dependencies, are
